        "label": "MANJULA’s origin story",
        "heading": "It started with eczema, and a recipe from my grandmother",
        "text": "<p>I've had eczema for as long as I can remember. I always treated my skin like something that needed to be fixed, rather than understood and honoured. After over 20 years of prescription ointments and trying every natural product I could find, I was still struggling to manage my skin long term. Around the same time, an autoimmune response triggered almost two years of persistent hair loss that brought me back to our family’s hair oil recipe and the Ayurvedic remedies my grandmother had always used.&nbsp;</p><p>Watching my hair and skin recover completely changed my relationship with my body. MANJULA was born out of that change, becoming everything that I’ve inherited and learned for myself.</p><p>Karishma Pranjivan<br/>Founder & Creative Director</p>"
      }
